{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-05-11 12:15:00', 'title': 'KETCHUM CHAIRMAN, PUBLIC RELATIONS INDUSTRY LUMINARY ROB FLAHERTY ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT AFTER 40-YEAR CAREER', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROB FLAHERTY, CHAIRMAN OF LEADING GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM, TODAY ANNOUNCED A PLANNED RETIREMENT AFTER AN ESTEEMED 40-YEAR CAREER AS AN INNOVATOR AND LEADER IN THE PUBLIC RELATIONS INDUSTRY AND MORE THAN 32 YEARS AT KETCHUM. HIS LAST DAY WITH THE FIRM WILL BE JUNE 15.'}